  "title": "Chicken Florentine Rice Casserole",
  "description": "This chicken, rice, and spinach casserole is packed with thyme, sage, basil, parsley, and marjoram — lots of flavor. It is an excellent and easy dish!",
  "authors": [
    "Christopher Shorts"
  ],
